{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-151339-r4523910","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Bison Meatballs Baked in Hoisin Sauce (Marvin)","sourcePageId":151339,"sourceRevision":"4523910","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-15T18:33:07Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Bison%20Meatballs%20Baked%20in%20Hoisin%20Sauce%20(Marvin)&oldid=4523910","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:43.580Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baked recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using basil","Category:Recipes using bison","Category:Recipes using canola oil","Category:Recipes using coriander","Category:Recipes using fish sauce","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using hoisin sauce","Category:Recipes using whole cumin","Category:United States recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"c4709b1f78f424f8cfd4598902c36a87007926d71ba89a1d909ad559eefd709a","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Bison recipes|servings=4|time=1 hour|difficulty=2}}\n__NOTOC__\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|United States]] | [[Cookbook:Meat Recipes|Meat]] | [[Cookbook:Bison|Bison]]\n\n'''Marvins''' are a quick and tasty variation on the meatball.\n\n==Ingredients==\n*1 large red [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] cloves, [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n*¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Cumin|cumin]] seeds\n*¼ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Coriander|coriander]] seeds\n*3 [[Cookbook:Pepper|peppercorns]]\n*2 whole [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n*¼ teaspoon sea [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (450 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) ground [[Cookbook:Bison|bison]] meat\n*½ cup cooked [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n*10 large [[Cookbook:Basil|basil]] leaves, [[Cookbook:Julienne|julienned]]\n*1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Canola Oil|canola oil]]\n*½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Fish Sauce|fish sauce]]\n*[[Cookbook:Hoisin Sauce|Hoisin sauce]]\n\n==Procedure==\n#Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 425°F (220°C). \n#Oil the bottom of a 9x12-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] Pyrex [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking dish]].  \n#Thinly slice the onion to create long thin slices.  \n#[[Cookbook:Microwaving|Microwave]] the onion slices and garlic on high for 5 minutes.  \n#Grind the cumin, coriander, peppercorns, cloves, and salt together using a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar and pestle]].  \n#Roughly mix the softened onions and garlic, bison, rice, spice grind, fish sauce, and basil.\n#Shape the meat mixture into tapered cylinders (similar to small sweet potatoes) and place into the baking dish. The Marvins should be about 1¼ inch diameter in the middle and 5 inches long.\n#Coat the Marvins with hoisin sauce.  \n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 20–25 minutes in the preheated oven.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n*Roll up in a warmed [[Cookbook:Mandarin Pancake|mooshi pancake]] with fresh [[Cookbook:Cilantro|cilantro]] or serve with a [[Cookbook:Coconut|coconut milk]]-based curry sauce and rice.\n\n==Warnings==\n*Always follow safe handling guidelines when using raw meat.\n\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bison]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using coriander]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using whole cumin]]\n[[Category:Recipes using canola oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hoisin sauce]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Bison Meatballs Baked in Hoisin Sauce (Marvin)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 large red onion","sourceText":"1 large red onion","amountText":"1 large red onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 garlic cloves, minced","sourceText":"2 garlic cloves, minced","amountText":"2 garlic cloves, minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¼ teaspoon cumin seeds","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon cumin seeds","amountText":"¼ teaspoon cumin seeds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ teaspoon coriander seeds","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon coriander seeds","amountText":"¼ teaspoon coriander seeds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 peppercorns","sourceText":"3 peppercorns","amountText":"3 peppercorns","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 whole cloves","sourceText":"2 whole cloves","amountText":"2 whole cloves","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"¼ teaspoon sea salt","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon sea salt","amountText":"¼ teaspoon sea salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 lb (450 g) ground bison meat","sourceText":"1 lb (450 g) ground bison meat","amountText":"1 lb (450 g) ground bison meat","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"½ cup cooked rice","sourceText":"½ cup cooked rice","amountText":"½ cup cooked rice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"10 large basil leaves, julienned","sour